Package: edjobs
Title: Shared Code for the Montana and Wyoming Education Jobs Dashboards
Version: 0.19.0
Authors@R: person("Mike", "Bostick", email = "michael.bostick@montana.edu", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Code shared by the Montana and Wyoming Education Jobs Dashboards:
    weekly checks of a run's output against written expectations, and, as the
    migration proceeds, scraping, classification, posting identity and the
    data checks both state pipelines use. Each state repository pins a tagged
    version.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Depends:
    R (>= 4.5.0)
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
Imports:
    dplyr,
    httr2,
    jsonlite,
    magrittr,
    readxl,
    rvest,
    stringr,
    stats,
    survival,
    utils,
    xml2
Suggests:
