    rmarkdown,
    testthat (>= 3.0.0),
    withr,
    writexl
VignetteBuilder: knitr
Config/testthat/edition: 3
Config/testthat/parallel: true
URL: https://github.com/bostickmike/edjobs
BugReports: https://github.com/bostickmike/edjobs/issues
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.1.1
